# Tool Calling
## [Tool Execution Approval](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/tools-and-tool-calling#tool-execution-approval)
### [Configure `toolApproval`](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/tools-and-tool-calling#configure-toolapproval)
```
const result = await generateText({
  model: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
  tools: { runCommand },
  toolApproval: {
    runCommand: 'user-approval',
  },
  prompt: 'Remove the most recent file in the downloads folder',
});
```

#### [Generic `toolApproval` function](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/tools-and-tool-calling#generic-toolapproval-function)
```
const result = await generateText({
  model: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
  tools: { runCommand },
  toolApproval: ({
    toolCall,
    tools,
    toolsContext,
    messages,
    runtimeContext,
  }) => {
    if (toolCall.toolName === 'runCommand' && !toolCall.dynamic) {
      // Inspect toolCall.input, cross-tool state, messages, or runtimeContext for policy.
      return 'user-approval';
    }
    return undefined; // or 'not-applicable'
  },
  prompt: 'Remove the most recent file in the downloads folder',
});
```

### [Handling Approval Requests](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/tools-and-tool-calling#handling-approval-requests)
```
import { type ModelMessage, generateText } from 'ai';

const messages: ModelMessage[] = [\
  { role: 'user', content: 'Remove the most recent file' },\
];
const result = await generateText({
  model: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
  tools: { runCommand },
  toolApproval: {
    runCommand: 'user-approval',
  },
  messages,
});

messages.push(...result.responseMessages);

for (const part of result.content) {
  if (part.type === 'tool-approval-request' && !part.isAutomatic) {
    console.log(part.approvalId); // Unique ID for this approval request
    console.log(part.toolCall); // Contains toolName, input, etc.
    console.log(part.reason); // Why this tool call requires approval
  }
}
```

# Tool Approvals
## [Security Considerations](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/agents/tool-approvals#security-considerations)
### [Signing approvals with `experimental_toolApprovalSecret`](https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/agents/tool-approvals#signing-approvals-with-experimental_toolapprovalsecret)
```
const agent = new ToolLoopAgent({
  model: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
  tools: { deleteFile, runQuery },
  toolApproval: { deleteFile: 'user-approval', runQuery: 'user-approval' },
  experimental_toolApprovalSecret: process.env.TOOL_APPROVAL_SECRET,
});

const result = await agent.generate({
  messages,
});
```

